Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A spy hired by a mysterious employer to monitor their rivals while disguised as civilians. They know the blockade inside-out, and prefer to first gather enough crucial information before proceeding to the next step of their plans.","abilities":["Spy","When their identity is revealed, becomes Invisible"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.65,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":800,"def":200,"res":35,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.3}},"sarkaz_absurdist_operative_leader":{"slug":"sarkaz_absurdist_operative_leader","name":"Sarkaz Absurdist Operative Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Absurdist Operative Leader.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Operatives attached to the Military Commission, primarily tasked with assassinating high-value targets. When on a mission, they often arrive before their subordinates to soften the enemy frontlines with incredible speed, while simultaneously planning their next action.","abilities":["Attacks reduce DP when carrying ammo. Ammo capacity: 3"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":7500,"atk":650,"def":350,"res":35,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"norport_civilian":{"slug":"norport_civilian","name":"Norport Civilian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Norport Civilian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Ordinary folk scattered throughout Norport Borough. Abandoned by Londinium and subjected to the Sarkaz's high-handed blockade, these orphans have become the ones most deeply affected by the haze of war.","abilities":["Friendly Unit","Once their identity is confirmed, restores your max DP after retreating to the Objective Poin